Mereka punya banyak pertanyaan untukku, tapi aku tidak bisa menjawabnya. Lagipula, kalian juga tidak akan percayaku, kan? Sekarang, di mataku, mereka hanya terlihat seperti sumber daya tenaga yang berguna. \"Sekarang ayo kita mulai bekerja, bayar sebanyak yang kamu makan!\" Kalau kita berhasil menemukan obat untuk virus, penyebab kehancuran dunia, masa-masa neraka kita akan berakhir. Jadi, ayo manfaatkan para tokoh utama pria sampai saat itu dan bertahanlah! Tapi ada satu masalah. Rumah tua yangki beli ternyata cukup mencurigakan. Apa yang sebenarnya terjadi di rumahku?","year":2024,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Isekai","Drama","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/d413c71b-8eb5-44c5-8590-7c38908de419/728eb19c-4ed5-48cd-abcb-4fb3eb4c9038.png.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["en","pl"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.94,"follows":3007,"listAt":"2026-10-24T01:08:23.734Z","chapters":[{"id":"bfa8b109-0df1-4ef2-9ed5-739da1be628d","number":"63","volume":"2","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":23,"createdAt":"2026-08-13T03:46:04+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"065ac81f-c29f-43ae-a079-a35d17da6cb1","number":"62","volume":"2","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":36,"createdAt":"2026-08-13T03:45:42+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"fd89683c-467f-472a-8a84-53d6511d0403","number":"61","volume":"2","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":36,"createdAt":"2026-06-27T06:13:14+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"9fda072d-0f2a-439b-8565-1fa9e9f6cfd3","number":"60","volume":"2","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":27,"createdAt":"2026-06-27T06:09:54+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"ed864e8c-028c-4c87-93fe-2235517e1d5f","number":"59","volume":"2","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":24,"createdAt":"2026-06-27T06:09:00+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"4e5e147b-b6e7-4b23-9ded-9c437aead3b2","number":"58","volume":"2","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":23,"createdAt":"2026-06-27T06:08:18+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"56e7c28d-feb5-4ce5-9712-c6b06bd1f03