null,"lang":"en","pages":6,"createdAt":"2025-01-12T23:08:27+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"9e233e0c-b6b7-41aa-bc3b-c8902ee9232d","number":"4","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":8,"createdAt":"2024-12-23T10:24:53+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"d1618f79-4c00-456e-af01-c12060826615","number":"3","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":8,"createdAt":"2024-11-28T11:21:34+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"fdc5fc3b-e150-4615-8860-805d29cda4e5","number":"2","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":8,"createdAt":"2024-11-24T20:35:53+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"2ac21384-087f-4ddd-b432-588d4cdd9faa","number":"1","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":9,"createdAt":"2024-11-15T18:01:24+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":11,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:32:15.175Z"},"fd5920bb-15cc-4525-b545-867d404b5e36":{"id":"fd5920bb-15cc-4525-b545-867d404b5e36","title":"The Cellhouse Kingmaker's Playbook","altTitle":"I Became a Leader in a Wretched Prison","description":"I Woke Up as the Leader of Prison?!\nI got transmigrated into a book, but—excuse me, what?!\nWhat am I supposed to do when I transmigrate ten years before the original story even starts?\n\nThe setting: prison.\nThe problem: it's worse than the jungle. A lawless war zone.\n\nAfter rolling through hell for ten years, I became…\n\nThe leader of the prison.\n\n\"Hey, Mint. You might wanna chill.\"\n\"I’m afraid I don’t know what you’re talking about, sir.\"\n\nI ended up a swaggering prison gang leader.\nBut hey, I’m fine with this.\nThis is what we call the privilege of a long-time survivor.\n\n\"On paper, you’ll be considered dead. In return, you’ll do a job for me.\"\n\"I’m afraid I still don’t understand, sir.\"\n\nThen a chance came—like a lie made real.\n\n\"Help me, and I’ll get you released.\"\n\"What do you need, Master?\"\n\"...\"\n\nThe prison chief gave an order to me—now known as the prison’s #1 certified nutcase:\n\n\"Turn the new guy into the boss of this prison.\"\n\nThey call it prison, but this place is a total free-for-all.\nAnd if I manage to crown one man as the next boss, I finally get out.\n\n\"But the place you're going to… is the men’s prison.\"\n\"...Huh? I don’t exactly have the thing for that?\"\n\"Disguise. Got it? Disguise!\"\n\n…Except—oops?\nTurns out that new recruit? He’s the original male lead.\n\n#ReincarnatedTenYearsTooSoon\n#AndNowI’mInPrison?! SurviveOrDie!\n#CrapIDon’tKnowAnything!\n#TenYearsLaterSurpriseI’mTheBoss\n#ButTheNewGuyIsTheML?!\n#PossessiveYoungerML × #UnbotheredFL & Their Savage Banter","year":null,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/fd5920bb-15cc-4525-b545-867d404b5e36/646ce8dd-616f-4bf5-8ac3-9dc04fa45baa.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["en"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.26,"follows":1891,"listAt":"2026-10-24T01:08:59.503Z","chapters":[{"id":"2c78d6c3-003e-47c9-a3e9-2852185e4643","number":"25","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":24,"createdAt":"2025-08-02T15:08:39+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"4b920734-433b-4d62-918b-dd0eb975f161","number":"24","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":28,"createdAt":"2025-07-26T14:11:00+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"d2cee056-8edb-43ab-84a9-b4d10b7b5887","number":"23","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":25,"createdAt":"2025-07-26T13:41:21+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"d57c263f-1b88-42bd-9f44-5b8992bc33cd","number":"22","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":25,"createdAt":"2025-07-26T13:40:57+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"ecc78ddc-30d2-4e4f-8a23-83007bbe1049","number":"21","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":24,"createdAt":"2025-07-26T13:39:37+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"9ba01e26-dcee-4c2e-91cb-7cc55e45fb0a","number":"20","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":24,"createdAt":"2025-07-26T13:39:06+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"2ad3f054-9be2-4308-ba9a-ebe447532be3","number":"19","volume":null,"ti